<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FocusAgent</span>: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
