<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Prompt Template</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A4.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ D.1 Prompt Template ‣ Appendix D LLM Retriever Additional Details ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> shows LLM retriever prompt of FocusAgent.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F12" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.F12.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="59.57" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 59.57" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,59.57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#8C8C8C;" fill="#8C8C8C" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 54.03 C 0 57.09 2.48 59.57 5.53 59.57 L 471.84 59.57 C 474.9 59.57 477.38 57.09 477.38 54.03 L 477.38 5.53 C 477.38 2.48 474.9 0 471.84 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 6.64 L 1.11 37.18 L 476.27 37.18 L 476.27 6.64 C 476.27 3.58 473.79 1.11 470.73 1.11 L 6.64 1.11 C 3.58 1.11 1.11 3.58 1.11 6.64 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 44.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="435.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
