<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F15.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 15</span>: </span><span id="A5.F15.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example of 2 of the 10 chunks from the observation given to agent in BM25Agent for task <span id="A5.F15.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">multi-chart-min-max-retrieval</span> seed 214 on WorkArena L1. Line tabs have been re-arranged for readability.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Note that all baselines and agents use an augmented version fo the AxTree using BrowserGym utils. The augmented features are set with the observation flags of GenericAgent and given in Figure <a href="#A5.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix E Retrieval Agents ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>.</p>
</div>
