<section id="A7.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.1 </span>Banner Attacks</h3>

<div id="A7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F19" title="Figure 19 ‣ G.1 Banner Attacks ‣ Appendix G Security ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a> show a banner attack on the webpage. Figure <a href="#A7.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ G.1 Banner Attacks ‣ Appendix G Security ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> shows the AxTree of a web page under banner attack.</p>
</div>
