<section id="A7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.2 </span>Popup Attacks</h3>

<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F23" title="Figure 23 ‣ G.2 Popup Attacks ‣ Appendix G Security ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a> show a popup attack on the webpage. Figure <a href="#A7.F22" title="Figure 22 ‣ G.2 Popup Attacks ‣ Appendix G Security ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a> shows the AxTree of a web page under popup attack.</p>
</div>
