<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Ablation Study</h2>

<section id="A8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.1 </span>Prompts</h3>

<div id="A8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">“Soft Prompting” is the regular FocusAgent prompt displayed in Figure <a href="#A4.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ D.1 Prompt Template ‣ Appendix D LLM Retriever Additional Details ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">“Aggressive Prompting” instruction is displayed in Figure <a href="#A8.F24" title="Figure 24 ‣ H.1 Prompts ‣ Appendix H Ablation Study ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">“Neutral Prompting” instruction is displayed in Figure <a href="#A8.F25" title="Figure 25 ‣ H.1 Prompts ‣ Appendix H Ablation Study ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>.</p>
</div>
