<section id="A8.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.3 </span>Max AxTree Pruning Examples</h3>

<div id="A8.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A8.F29" title="Figure 29 ‣ H.3 Max AxTree Pruning Examples ‣ Appendix H Ablation Study ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">29</span></a> shows an example of an AxTree with 96% tokens pruned on WorkArena L1.</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A8.F30" title="Figure 30 ‣ H.3 Max AxTree Pruning Examples ‣ Appendix H Ablation Study ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">30</span></a> shows an example of an AxTree with 99% tokens pruned on WorkArena L1.</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A8.F31" title="Figure 31 ‣ H.3 Max AxTree Pruning Examples ‣ Appendix H Ablation Study ‣ FocusAgent: Simple Yet Effective Ways of Trimming the Large Context of Web Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a> shows an example of an AxTree with 99% tokens pruned on WebArena.</p>
</div>
